s=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">嫌う</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">きらう</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅰ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅰ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">讨厌；厌恶；憎恶；回避；躲避；不顾；不在乎；漠视；有害于；对…不利</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"88447\"><ruby>彼女<rp>(</rp><rt>かのじょ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>人前<rp>(</rp><rt>ひとまえ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>で<ruby>話<rp>(</rp><rt>はなし</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>をするのを<ruby>嫌<rp>(</rp><rt>きら</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>う。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">She detests speaking in public.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">霧</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">きり</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">雾；迷雾；喷雾；水雾</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"121753\"><ruby>濃<rp>(</rp><rt>こ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>い<ruby>霧<rp>(</rp><rt>きり</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>のために<ruby>私<rp>(</rp><rt>わたし</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>たちの<ruby>飛行機<rp>(</rp><rt>ひこうき</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>遅<rp>(</rp><rt>おく</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>れた。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">A thick fog delayed our flight.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">切れ</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">きれ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">片；条；段；碎片；布；布料；锋利；锐利；敏捷；灵活；片；条（计数词）</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"142112\"><ruby>切<rp>(</rp><rt>き</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>れはずたずたに<ruby>切<rp>(</rp><rt>き</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>り<ruby>裂<rp>(</rp><rt>さ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>かれた。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">The cloth was torn to shreds.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">切れる</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">きれる</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅱ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅱ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">断裂；折断；被切断；裂开；破裂；受伤；磨损；破损；断裂；爆裂；崩溃；失效；停止运作；断电；期满；到期；截止；缺货；用尽；耗尽；售罄；断货；断绝（关系等）；分手；断交；中断；失去联系；切割锋利；快刀利刃；头脑敏锐；机灵；精明；反应快；能干；低于（某数值）；不足；破（纪录）；沥干；晾干；弯曲；转向；洗牌；生气；发怒；爆发；发火；情绪失控；能够完全做到</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"226379\">ガソリンが<ruby>切<rp>(</rp><rt>き</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>れかかっている。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">We&#x27;re running out of gas.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">記録</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">きろく</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">记录；文件；会议记录；日志；录音；记载；存档；纪录（如体育比赛）；创纪录；刷新纪录</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"80936\"><ruby>無言<rp>(</rp><rt>むごん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>が<ruby>記録<rp>(</rp><rt>きろく</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>されたためしはない。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">No silence was ever written down.</span></div></li>"]